{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Reject fractional attempt values in envelopes.** Disabling `ALLOW_COERCION_OF_SCALARS` does not disable Jackson's default `ACCEPT_FLOAT_AS_INT`, so `producerContext.attempt: 1.5` is truncated to `1` and accepted. Context-keyed offloaders then receive a producer context that was never emitted, contrary to fail-closed parsing. Disable this coercion and add fractional-attempt coverage.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7orDgk","finding_digest":"d125247bade6c63642bf5eac4ba8e95ebcf5653665debda708f724915819edb6","finding_id":"arf_v1_2essi65n43ddmqv7l2wexkhjl2","finding_key":"sdk/execution/payloadcodec::envelope-serdes::strict-scalar-types","identity_key":"sdk/execution/payloadcodec::envelope-serdes::strict-scalar-types","line":54,"observation_digest":"798de1e222976d18588ffafabfef7225426be9b58ec60e92ec7016b5e1c0246f","observation_id":"aro_v1_pgg6dyrcs5wrqwep7l5l733sev","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/PayloadCodec.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_2essi65n43ddmqv7l2wexkhjl2","published_at":"2026-09-01T11:24:09Z","review_id":"arr_v1_abor7bd26fs7iy3tburwxzwhjg","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"86d113eb900d5e847f2e29081d180b322c12b54a","reviewer":"codex","start_line":54,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_s7wzpwl6qjjyskccjuxl5dlanu"},"pull_request":{"number":649},"record_id":"art_v1_act6oop4vcd3t7pt6va6kn7zid","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T11:24:09Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
